            <div xml:id="m-ada931e3-42c6-4609-8df1-65e44efd0e57">
              <lg xml:id="m-283ac520-6cc2-4a2e-8d77-b0f876812727">
                <l xml:id="m-a60b5562-ee39-4d9e-a114-c962c66b7eb2" facs="#m-1d1bb06b-7289-405b-82b6-cad64e5e81ec" label="ambiguous">842</l><l xml:id="m-8bae1521-b77d-4e8c-822c-0e04e6d3a073" facs="#m-923e486f-713e-4fd0-b864-09131549003d" label="text-like">The Greater and Lesser Litanies.</l><l xml:id="m-8abb72d0-b797-4b59-9a3e-f3a8d0459bcb" facs="#m-14bcbce4-1d7c-4cb3-9122-967be183431b" label="lyrics-like">humi-li- tá-tem mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fba7282-f474-40dd-addd-7bc75d228fd4" facs="#m-20c611e9-2973-4433-8d28-eaadf9876b14" label="ambiguous">sti</l><l xml:id="m-d0f9eaa8-0205-4e1f-ade4-fb47e3a255d3" facs="#m-89fc3e81-4aea-4daa-828e-b475357913c1" label="lyrics-like">salvá- sti de ne-cessi-tá¬ tibus* ánimam</l><l xml:id="m-3a771ac1-c3ac-44f6-9ff8-208a0b62219d" facs="#m-af26c047-75f8-4b4a-b5da-74e716f3033a" label="ambiguous">am:</l><l xml:id="m-877c80d0-50e0-46eb-be96-a65ec02cadd8" facs="#m-35f5883e-4bb0-49c8-8727-592473ec42a0" label="lyrics-like">mé- am.</l><l xml:id="m-30fc12dc-b8b6-4ad2-8b36-0ed8d64da27c" facs="#m-a4163206-ef57-405f-95fc-8d740f47bd55" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 11</l><l xml:id="m-4f6d2dba-f4bf-409f-acde-60fb76b8e8b0" facs="#m-d5fdd10e-5cf3-4a91-a111-a4264edc3e7f" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí-quot habet necessários. Et exo dico</l><l xml:id="m-440883fe-6e7a-49eb-b8d5-376b7923a864" facs="#m-6d9ed6ee-9fd8-4a88-b385-ffb29e92720b" label="lyrics-like">A pulis suis: Quis vestrum habé¬</l><l xml:id="m-96fd426f-c940-47c3-9ad0-6727f9528767" facs="#m-a8057de8-4246-41ad-b842-6d5997220bdc" label="lyrics-like">vobis: Pétite, et dábitur vobis:</l><l xml:id="m-cd338255-2137-42d5-bfac-09c3a9253619" facs="#m-d282b300-53fe-48dc-b7bc-4d45b2aa78b4" label="lyrics-like">quaérite, et inveniétis: pulsáte, et</l><l xml:id="m-ff5756f6-df4b-4e61-bce8-6fc9a365c951" facs="#m-35dc78bb-df7f-4242-a771-26cdfb8876e6" label="lyrics-like">bit amicum, et ibit ad illum média</l><l xml:id="m-3a8dfb93-82c5-4601-adf4-edb4aad5823a" facs="#m-8a022ccd-13ba-4f63-ba94-8a9ecb2df605" label="lyrics-like">nocte, et dicet illi: Amíce, cóm¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2071f57-0367-4e65-9628-a71c313be030" facs="#m-a3cafba3-a9f3-4a18-af64-7e5b20cec2fb" label="lyrics-like">aperiétur vobis. Omnis enim qui</l><l xml:id="m-4197f64e-cd0c-4bf8-a1d1-ef94db2affd3" facs="#m-fe17f445-260c-4d83-9f49-af0b9e51a7fe" label="lyrics-like">petit, áccipit: et qui quaerit, inve¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c3e417c-6ad4-4dc5-bd6b-2b3a2589deb1" facs="#m-23f5c378-2307-447e-915d-5be3674eb2f1" label="lyrics-like">moda mihi tres panes, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-64e0972f-fbb7-42bf-bfc7-231ced9ec047" facs="#m-d393b5f1-f146-49f5-9497-4fbc5212d1b3" label="lyrics-like">amícus meus venit de via ad me, et</l><l xml:id="m-7d3eb03b-3dd3-4299-b6eb-a975a071f48c" facs="#m-0f960dcf-4888-41f3-bea7-4fbe01409e38" label="lyrics-like">nit : et pulsánti aperiétur. Quis au¬</l><l xml:id="m-e8a358c9-5f82-41a7-823c-8e8e1884d6b0" facs="#m-e2bad5c9-770c-4d31-8890-6066b2cfa47d" label="ambiguous">tem ex vobis patrem petit panem,</l><l xml:id="m-25df0711-602c-4e7a-9590-80f47e60d0a2" facs="#m-b9c6ecf7-3914-4051-a462-f07909eb367e" label="lyrics-like">non hábeo quod ponam ante illum:</l><l xml:id="m-8f0ed946-8aa9-4775-b2da-a6fe1319c1dd" facs="#m-fe63c574-50e7-4080-a32c-f7b9269339a2" label="lyrics-like">numquid lápidem dabit illi? Aut</l><l xml:id="m-94963ff0-729b-4af1-a33e-799c55f9ecf8" facs="#m-5df1b5fb-3370-45b1-88a9-35f92f75a043" label="lyrics-like">et ille deintus respóndens, dicat:</l><l xml:id="m-5c1c253d-9d45-46ed-8a46-30e3c21ba4c1" facs="#m-88ed138a-ad38-4c68-bff2-00ddd341855a" label="lyrics-like">Noli mihi moléstus esse, jam óstium</l><l xml:id="m-ede29a76-93ab-4d12-9ce0-3c85a8b8d8d8" facs="#m-1361ed26-c0a5-4f06-b78a-7e74b526c64b" label="lyrics-like">piscem: numquid pro pisce serpén¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd5697e3-f7e8-4c06-9380-2f50853daafc" facs="#m-f0656482-c9a5-42d9-a4af-a7a1f1ea5124" label="ambiguous">tem dabit illi? Aut si petlerit ovum:</l><l xml:id="m-7b63d97b-4770-4c66-a9c2-154efd38c7c8" facs="#m-4ee6a19b-4283-4da7-8fda-e3205c601693" label="lyrics-like">clausum est, et púeri mei mecum</l><l xml:id="m-f98c08d2-1bfb-44c8-9018-174b303705fb" facs="#m-9bb54f5e-0bdc-4852-b902-236eafe6df60" label="lyrics-like">sunt in cubili, non possum súrgere,</l><l xml:id="m-378a7ae0-cce1-40a7-8985-19bf158954ab" facs="#m-f3713dad-f8cf-4c44-9c52-54cc8624e661" label="lyrics-like">numquid pórriget illi scorpiónem?</l><l xml:id="m-f64e05a1-fa59-4327-bd5d-9c0df4616bca" facs="#m-610032e0-6310-4dc1-8976-4b7cfa31ea8e" label="lyrics-like">et dare tibi. Et si ille perseveráve¬</l><l xml:id="m-20e19048-d6b0-45a0-be77-2acef743815c" facs="#m-b5c14d99-fce0-4149-8c02-16750054989f" label="ambiguous">si ergo vos cum sitis mali, nostis</l><l xml:id="m-6aef8f30-8e61-4ea4-98db-777e5bf9e64d" facs="#m-d0767ed3-ea79-4bb8-add5-50323d7b29d6" label="ambiguous">bona data dare filiis vestris : quan¬</l><l xml:id="m-d94c5f29-1b33-488d-af7e-0b6442c847ec" facs="#m-171bdc73-a7fb-482f-85f7-777c6ba061af" label="ambiguous">rit pulsans: dico vobis, et si non</l><l xml:id="m-94323b94-49cf-4c88-99f6-5428c3154f9b" facs="#m-be2fd0b7-9c0c-47ee-8fbb-c2cd9d959db6" label="ambiguous">to magis Pater vester de caelo da¬</l><l xml:id="m-306b2a28-e65a-4d0f-b0d4-025423425066" facs="#m-931cdeb0-168f-45e8-ab00-b4129e718671" label="lyrics-like">dabit illi surgens, eo quod amícus</l><l xml:id="m-55fcd36a-16ce-4b2b-b16e-6fb7bfae35c4" facs="#m-238b2dba-4794-4214-babc-6b0e0bd6518d" label="lyrics-like">ejus sit, propter improbitátem ta¬</l><l xml:id="m-cddad062-c20e-43c3-bfa7-e2ad603dd912" facs="#m-bb596c32-c7e2-44eb-86a6-b34a6d54aa8a" label="lyrics-like">bit spiritum bonum peténtibus se?</l><l xml:id="m-8e006992-0adc-445d-a462-0f446be5d8a3" facs="#m-b5f9b425-051f-40e9-ab78-b184239604b9" label="ambiguous">men ejus surget, et dabit illi quot¬</l><l xml:id="m-80485b72-eac1-4767-8f89-94f725e1060c" facs="#m-ca3a3fcd-f558-4865-9bea-4c39cec2c7c4" label="ambiguous">ofert.!</l><l xml:id="m-82353af5-30b2-4732-8fb0-548fc23c1bf2" facs="#m-a8740c21-b91f-4941-b84c-921d7329c7a9" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-6ee898ab-9971-48c7-999d-03eca04299cb" facs="#m-2730de0d-9bcc-4214-9966-34474993d07c" label="lyrics-like">Onfi-té-bor“ Dómino ni¬ mis</l><l xml:id="m-49e46bed-a089-4c8b-a350-eccd0918749e" facs="#m-cbdc6c42-5087-40e2-9862-9f8de388edb4" label="lyrics-like">in óre mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7b2d1ab2-1a9c-49c2-bd3f-bc49d1e7a359" facs="#m-ff0e4bd1-50fc-4608-bf64-4c75f8ffe83c" label="lyrics-like">et in mé-di- multó- rum laudábo</l><l xml:id="m-00df2652-b9e1-4475-8435-3057a901f3e3" facs="#m-331d9c40-d44c-4119-966b-69dae48ed3b2" label="ambiguous">o:</l><l xml:id="m-c869059b-ae6e-4dc4-9cd0-f295a6142b9d" facs="#m-34a3a3eb-5df0-44d3-83cc-37f34deb604d" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-56f5cc22-9387-4eb3-b23b-c541c71305f4" facs="#m-22b4a268-c92a-4b1c-a391-1e75f99ff727" label="lyrics-like">um, qui ásti- tit ad déx-te-ram páu-pe¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4de7289-2c18-41ee-9a11-3220702f1e8a" facs="#m-ef460c0c-853d-469a-b720-3e552579bf42" label="ambiguous">ris,</l><l xml:id="m-82874e7d-8d3c-4178-8f01-70bf1a3f5e16" facs="#m-8abb67bd-a501-4805-b9ec-b8405b422557" label="lyrics-like">ut sál- vam fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e8d7513-9f42-4d0e-9905-e2956537061f" facs="#m-7c354901-e9fd-4d04-8107-33715d6d4da7" label="lyrics-like">a perse- quén¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa911ccf-2ce8-4e02-ab71-3b42c811902b" facs="#m-9e50589d-fc9f-46f1-8e01-d90c946a4fb3" label="ambiguous">ce-ret</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
